00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:19.010
And the way that you get us to that point
is by 20 years of slowly normalizing, normalizing

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:20.890
it, normalizing, normalizing.

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:26.810
There's no question that the dehumanize dehumanization,
