all of the, it all has to be on done and unfortunately

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:13.580
it's like decades of stuff.

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:18.140
And so I don't know exactly how we start doing
it and I'm not super optimistic that it can

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:20.060
